<title>UK: Pet City approves PETsMART merger.</title>
<headline>Pet City approves PETsMART merger.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders in British pet store operator Pet City Holdings Plc meeting on Friday approved all of a merGer with U.S.-based PETsMART, the company said.</p>
<p>Under the merger deal, announced on October 25, the U.S. firm will absorb Pet City for an estimated 150.2 million stg.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to become effective on December 18.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
